WEBVTT

asr-000086
00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:29.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Good afternoon, ladies and gentlemen. Thank you for attending today's briefing on the fiscal year 2027 proposed expenditure program of the Department of Finance, attached agencies and corporations. I call the briefing to order. Since the plenary session is ongoing, we shall wait for our other colleagues to join us later on.

asr-000087
00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:40.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So at this juncture, I'd like to recognize the Committee Secretary to acknowledge the resource persons present for today.

asr-000087-split-2
00:40:40.000 --> 00:40:59.980
Committee Secretary: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Good afternoon. For the briefing on the proposed FY 2027 budget of the Department of Finance and attached agencies and corporations: the Bureau of Customs, Bureau of Internal Revenue, Bureau of Local Government Finance, Bureau of the Treasury, Central Board of Assessment Appeals, Insurance Commission and National Tax Research Center,

asr-000088
00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:29.980
Committee Secretary: the Privatization and Management Office, and the Philippine Tax Academy. We would like to acknowledge our resource persons from DOF. We have Secretary Frederick Go together with Undersecretary Maria Edita Tan, Undersecretary Bayani Agabin, Undersecretary NiÃ±o Raymond Alvina, Undersecretary Carlo Fermin Adriano, Undersecretary Catherine Fong, Undersecretary Maria Angela Ignacio, Undersecretary Rolando Ligon Jr., and Undersecretary Joven Balbosa.

asr-000089
00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:59.980
Committee Secretary: Assistant Secretary Neil Adrian Cabiles, Assistant Secretary Chris Joy Diaz Teston, Assistant Secretary Angelica Sarmiento, Assistant Secretary Juvida Nafrata and Assistant Secretary Joel Baloro. For the attached agencies, we have BOC Commissioner Ariel Nepomuceno together with Assistant Secretary Jeek Casipit; BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin Mendoza with Deputy Commissioners Marisa Cabreros and Teresita Angeles; and BLGF Executive Director Ryan Martine.

asr-000090
00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:29.800
Committee Secretary: For the Bureau of the Treasury, Treasurer Sharon Almanza and Deputy Treasurer Kenneth Ian Francisco. For CBAA, Chairperson Robert Tobia and board member Attorney Gualberto Oison. For the Insurance Commission, OIC and Deputy Commissioner for the Management Support Services Group, Deputy Commissioner Ermar Benitez. For NTRC, Executive Director Mark Lester Aure. For PMO, Undersecretary Michael Peter Alejandro.

asr-000094
00:42:29.800 --> 00:42:52.160
Committee Secretary: For PTA, we have President Kiel Beltran. Also present are the heads of the government corporations without subsidy under the proposed FY2027 NEP. For SEC, we have Chairperson Francis Ed Lim. For Field Guarantee, we have President Alberto Pascual and Senior Vice President Giselle Pangal. For DBP, we have President Michael De Jesus and Executive Vice President Catherine Magana.

asr-000095
00:42:52.160 --> 00:43:07.260
Committee Secretary: For LBP, we have PCEO Maria Lynette Ortiz. For Maharlika Investment Corporation, we have PCEO Rafael Jose Consing Jr. and General Counsel Paul Salanga. For SSS, we have PCEO Robert Joseph Declaro.

asr-000096
