asr-004563
03:33:27.000 --> 03:33:34.140
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: I believe as I mentioned earlier, we acted very fast, very quickly, and removed VAT on

asr-004564
03:33:34.140 --> 03:33:36.360
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: systems loss just last month.

asr-004565
03:33:38.300 --> 03:33:40.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, on another topic lang po.

asr-004566
03:33:40.980 --> 03:33:42.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: May kli lang po ito.

asr-004567
03:33:42.980 --> 03:33:48.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam nun naman po natin ang micro, small, and medium enterprises or MSMEs.

asr-004568
03:33:48.300 --> 03:33:53.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito po yung maliliit na negosyo ay mahalagang bahagi po ng ating ekonomiya.

asr-004569
03:33:54.120 --> 03:33:58.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam nyo po yun, lalong-lalo na po si Secretary Igo na mula sa business sector po.

asr-004570
03:33:59.400 --> 03:34:06.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Bago ka pumasok sa gobyerno, may ka pong natulungan ng mga maliliit na negosyante noon.

asr-004571
03:34:07.760 --> 03:34:13.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito pong MSMEs, they provide jobs, livelihood, and opportunities to many of our kababayan.

asr-004572
03:34:13.660 --> 03:34:15.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ngunit sa kabila ng kanilang mahalagang papel,

asr-004573
03:34:16.580 --> 03:34:17.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sila pong madalas na nakakarana.

asr-004574
03:34:18.300 --> 03:34:23.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sila pong madalas po ng mabigat na requirements at bayarin mula sa iba't-ibang ahensya na gobyerno.

asr-004575
03:34:23.120 --> 03:34:26.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At nabanggit nyo po kanina na yun po yung ginagawa ninyo,

asr-004576
03:34:26.160 --> 03:34:29.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: streamlining processes, reduced fees.

asr-004577
03:34:30.540 --> 03:34:34.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At kung maalala nyo po, during the time of former President Duterte,

asr-004578
03:34:34.360 --> 03:34:37.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: he signed into law Republic Act 11032.

asr-004579
03:34:38.160 --> 03:34:43.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito po yung Ease of Doing Business Act to Reduce Red Tape in Government Services.

asr-004580
03:34:43.500 --> 03:34:48.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po yung mapagaan din natin ang mga obligasyon at pasanin ng ating mga MSMEs

asr-004581
03:34:48.300 --> 03:34:50.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito po yung mga maliliit na negosyante.

asr-004582
03:34:50.780 --> 03:34:52.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Malaking tulong po ito sa kanila.

asr-004583
03:34:52.700 --> 03:34:57.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dapat po yung maturuan sila ng tamang proseso para mainganyo ang ating mga kababayan na magnegosyo.

asr-004584
03:34:58.200 --> 03:35:06.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: To the DOF and BIR, what are your efforts in simplifying procedures and tax obligations of MSMEs?

asr-004585
03:35:08.180 --> 03:35:12.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Please, BIR, Commissioner Mendoza, please answer the query.

asr-004586
03:35:13.360 --> 03:35:16.740
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Good afternoon, Mr. Chair, Senator Goh.

asr-004587
03:35:18.300 --> 03:35:23.640
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Nauunawaan po namin na bagamat ang principal na mandate po ng Bureau of Internal Revenue

asr-004588
03:35:23.640 --> 03:35:28.620
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: is manglekta ng buwis upang matustusan natin ang mga pangangailangan ng gobyerno.

asr-004589
03:35:28.940 --> 03:35:37.560
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: But at the same time, we have the equally important mandate of helping in making doing business in the Philippines much easier.

asr-004590
03:35:38.140 --> 03:35:42.540
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Kaya yan rin po ay isa sa mga prioridad po ng kasalukuyang administrasyon.

asr-004591
03:35:43.100 --> 03:35:46.760
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Patungkol po sa mga micro and small entrepreneurs natin,

asr-004592
03:35:46.760 --> 03:35:56.720
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: ito po ay nabangkit nga ng Pangulo noong kanyang SONA na sa kasalukuyan po ay nagpapatupad tayo ng isang one-time tax abatement program for our microtax payers.

asr-004593
03:35:57.280 --> 03:36:03.980
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Ang mga microtax payers po ay ito po yung ang gross sales sa isang taon ay hindi lumalampas sa 3 million pesos.

asr-004594
03:36:04.540 --> 03:36:11.360
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: At karaniwan po ay sila ang maraming halimbawa open cases sa BIR, hindi sila nakakapag-file ng returns,

asr-004595
03:36:11.560 --> 03:36:16.740
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: nagsara na sila, subalit hindi nila alam na kinakailangan din nilang formally na magsara sa BIR.

asr-004596
03:36:16.760 --> 03:36:26.500
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Kung kaya't pag bumalik po sila at magtatayo sila ng bagong nebosyo, magpaparehistro, lalabas yung pangalan ng previous business nila at nagkakaproblema po sila sa pagkuhan ng clearance.

asr-004597
03:36:27.080 --> 03:36:35.360
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: So yan po ay nauunawaan natin. Kaya una po, nagsagawa po tayo ng tinatawag na ease of closing business na pinatipo din po natin ngayong taon.

asr-004598
03:36:35.520 --> 03:36:39.940
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Sabi natin kung merong ease of doing business, meron din dapat ease of closing business.

asr-004599
03:36:40.240 --> 03:36:46.100
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Sapagkat dati-dati po magsasara ka na ng negosyo, maaring nalugi ka pero mahihirapan ka pang magsara.

asr-004600
03:36:46.760 --> 03:36:52.320
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Sapagkat napakaraming requirements na hinihingi at yan po ay nilimitahan na lamang po natin ang requirements.

asr-004601
03:36:52.880 --> 03:36:58.880
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: At ang isa pong malaking tulong na ginawa natin para sa ating mga maliliit na negosyo, yung ating mga micro-entrepreneurs.

asr-004602
03:36:59.200 --> 03:37:06.060
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Dati-dati po kung magsasara ang negosyo, meron po kasi tayong tinatawag na mandatory audit before natin sila bigyan ng clearance to check.

asr-004603
03:37:06.060 --> 03:37:09.100
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Na wala po talaga silang paglabag sa ating mga tax regulations.

asr-004604
03:37:09.680 --> 03:37:16.560
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: But what we did po is tinanggal po natin ang ating mga micro-tax payers from the requirement of a mandatory audit.

asr-004605
03:37:16.760 --> 03:37:26.280
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Kaya sa loob lamang po ng tatlong araw, kung kumpleto na ang kanilang dokumento, maaari na po nilang maisara formally ang kanilang registration with BIR.

asr-004606
03:37:26.760 --> 03:37:32.200
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Ngayon po, na-realize namin na bagamat sinimplihan natin ang mga requirements,

asr-004607
03:37:32.600 --> 03:37:35.660
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: napakarami po mga maliliit na negosyo, micro-small entrepreneurs.

asr-004608
03:37:36.280 --> 03:37:42.420
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Micro-entrepreneurs in particular na marami na po silang tax liability sa BIR na nanahihirapan silang bayaran.

asr-004609
03:37:42.420 --> 03:37:46.680
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Kung kaya po naglunsag po tayo ngayong taon ng tinatawag natin na tax abatement.

asr-004610
03:37:46.760 --> 03:37:48.460
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Program for micro-tax payers.

asr-004611
03:37:49.000 --> 03:37:56.860
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: At ikinalulugod ko pong ipaalam sa inyo na sa loob lamang po ng dalawang buwan simula nang inulunsad natin ito,

asr-004612
03:37:56.980 --> 03:38:02.340
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: ay nakareceive na po kami ng 6,300 more or less na applications for tax abatement.

asr-004613
03:38:02.820 --> 03:38:05.820
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: At mahigit 5,000 na po ang na-approve natin.

asr-004614
03:38:05.820 --> 03:38:16.520
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: At ito po ay nangangahulugan ng 80 plus million in tax liabilities na na-condone po natin sa pagbabayad lamang nila ng 5,000 pesos na tax abatement.

asr-004615
03:38:16.520 --> 03:38:18.360
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: At ito po ay nangangahulugan ng 80 plus million per taxable year.

asr-004616
03:38:18.980 --> 03:38:27.100
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Maliban po dyan, karaniwan hong naririnig po natin, maliit na negosyo lang kami pero ang hirap ng compliance namin.

asr-004617
03:38:27.560 --> 03:38:29.320
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Mahaba yung form, mahirap intindihin.

asr-004618
03:38:29.780 --> 03:38:37.680
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Kung kaya ngayong taon din po, pinasimple po natin ang income tax filing return for our micro and small taxpayers.

asr-004619
03:38:38.320 --> 03:38:41.880
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Ang form po natin kasi dyan is yung 1701.

asr-004620
03:38:41.880 --> 03:38:46.340
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: So gumawa po tayo ng 1701 MS for micro taxpayers.

asr-004621
03:38:46.520 --> 03:38:47.580
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Available po online.

asr-004622
03:38:48.020 --> 03:38:52.720
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Ito po ay mas maiksi at mas kaunting requirements lamang ang hinihingi natin sa kanila.

asr-004623
03:38:53.540 --> 03:38:54.440
BIR Commissioner Charlito Martin R. Mendoza: Thank you po, Mr.

asr-004624
03:38:54.440 --> 03:38:55.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po.

asr-004625
03:38:55.240 --> 03:38:59.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Totoo po yun sa mga nalulugi na negosyante.

asr-004626
03:38:59.400 --> 03:39:00.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nahirapan po silang magsara.

asr-004627
03:39:01.720 --> 03:39:03.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At meron po akong narinig po na reklamo.

asr-004628
03:39:03.980 --> 03:39:05.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung matagal rin po ang proseso.

asr-004629
03:39:05.380 --> 03:39:05.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung sa SEC.

asr-004630
03:39:06.560 --> 03:39:13.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ano bang ginawa niyong proseso na ma-streamline po itong pagsasara ng negosyo?

asr-004631
03:39:13.860 --> 03:39:14.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Imbis na...

asr-004632
03:39:16.520 --> 03:39:18.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lugi na nga yung mga negosyante.

asr-004633
03:39:19.260 --> 03:39:23.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pahirapan pa silang mag-retire o magsara ng kanilang negosyo.

asr-004634
03:39:24.460 --> 03:39:28.960
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mabilis lang ba ang proseso ngayon sa SEC, Mr. Francis Lee?

asr-004635
03:39:28.980 --> 03:39:33.080
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Sa katotohanan, hindi pa namin inaabutan yan.

asr-004636
03:39:33.660 --> 03:39:36.440
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Ang ginagawa namin yung ease of doing business.

asr-004637
03:39:37.140 --> 03:39:38.220
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Madali ng registration.

asr-004638
03:39:39.300 --> 03:39:42.900
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Nagbigay kami ng discounts for MSM East trying to register.

asr-004639
03:39:42.900 --> 03:39:46.500
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Kung pupunta sila sa capital market, 20% discount yan.

asr-004640
03:39:46.520 --> 03:39:51.960
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Kung pupunta sila sa capital market to raise funds, may 50% discount kami sa registration fee.

asr-004641
03:39:52.580 --> 03:39:58.700
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Ngayon, napansin namin na bumibilis na yung registration namin, Mr. Senator.

asr-004642
03:39:59.500 --> 03:40:04.440
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Pero isang problema ng isang negosyante, siguro na ano nyo ito, na-register na sila.

asr-004643
03:40:04.900 --> 03:40:07.120
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Mahirap sila mag-umpisa ng negosyo.

asr-004644
03:40:07.540 --> 03:40:11.500
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: In other words, dahil register na, hindi sila makapag-umpisa ng negosyo

asr-004645
03:40:11.500 --> 03:40:15.000
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: dahil kukuha pa sila ng permit sa LGU, sa SSS, at so on.

asr-004646
03:40:15.000 --> 03:40:16.480
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: So, may proposal ako.

asr-004647
03:40:16.520 --> 03:40:23.060
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Inapprove ni Secretary Goh na once naregister na yung company, malilit na company, malalaking company,

asr-004648
03:40:23.060 --> 03:40:30.040
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: they can start doing business, commercial operations, while they're applying for all these permits.

asr-004649
03:40:30.040 --> 03:40:35.540
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Fire permit, occupancy permit, building permit, and so on, so forth, for a period of 60 days.

asr-004650
03:40:35.540 --> 03:40:43.960
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Ngayon, sangayon kami sa ginagawa ng BIR na in terms of ease of doing business,

asr-004651
03:40:43.960 --> 03:40:45.500
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: that's not only

asr-004652
03:40:45.500 --> 03:40:50.540
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: start with the registration, but also on how to close down business.

asr-004653
03:40:50.540 --> 03:40:55.340
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Ako, isang practitioner ho, bago ako naging SEC chairman.

asr-004654
03:40:55.340 --> 03:40:59.060
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Ang hirap talaga magsaraan ng negosyo.

asr-004655
03:40:59.060 --> 03:41:02.140
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Meron kang exemption sa tax liabilities, di ba?

asr-004656
03:41:02.140 --> 03:41:05.140
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Dapat bayaran mo yan, certificate, ano.

asr-004657
03:41:05.140 --> 03:41:09.140
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: So, we will go there.

asr-004658
03:41:09.140 --> 03:41:14.940
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: But ang priority namin is how to get more businesses

asr-004659
03:41:14.940 --> 03:41:16.940
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: into the economy.

asr-004660
03:41:16.940 --> 03:41:20.940
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Ngayon sa financial statements, isang problema ito ng maliliit.

asr-004661
03:41:20.940 --> 03:41:27.940
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Dati, kung may 600,000 assets ka, kailangan ang audited financial statements.

asr-004662
03:41:27.940 --> 03:41:30.940
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: And we all know na magbabayad ka sa auditor.

asr-004663
03:41:30.940 --> 03:41:35.940
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Tinanggal namin yun, I think tinaas namin yung threshold to 3 million.

asr-004664
03:41:35.940 --> 03:41:41.940
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: In other words, 3 million or ba no, hindi mo kailangan mag-submit sa SEC ng audited financial statement.

asr-004665
03:41:41.940 --> 03:41:44.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: A statement of management responsibility.

asr-004666
03:41:44.780 --> 03:41:47.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: At totoo, tama yung figure nila would be enough.

asr-004667
03:41:47.780 --> 03:41:49.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: So, yun.

asr-004668
03:41:49.780 --> 03:41:55.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: I think sa closing of business, pag nag-shorten na ng corporate term, for example.

asr-004669
03:41:55.780 --> 03:41:58.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: That's the usual way of closing business.

asr-004670
03:41:58.780 --> 03:42:01.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Sina-shorten nyo lang.

asr-004671
03:42:01.780 --> 03:42:04.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Meron kaming mandali na yung pag-close.

asr-004672
03:42:04.780 --> 03:42:08.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Because we have a deemed-approved policy for simple transactions.

asr-004673
03:42:08.780 --> 03:42:12.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: And we got this from the EODB law.

asr-004674
03:42:12.780 --> 03:42:14.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Simple transactions, 3 days.

asr-004675
03:42:14.780 --> 03:42:16.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Moderate transactions, 7 days.

asr-004676
03:42:16.780 --> 03:42:19.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: And complex transactions, 20 days.

asr-004677
03:42:19.780 --> 03:42:23.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: Pag hindi na-approved doon that period, and the fault is ours,

asr-004678
03:42:23.780 --> 03:42:27.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: compliant yung company, deemed-approved yung closing business.

asr-004679
03:42:27.780 --> 03:42:30.780
SEC Chairperson Francisco Ed Lim: That's what I can commit, Mr. Chairman.

asr-004680
03:42:30.780 --> 03:42:32.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat, Chairperson Francis Lim.

asr-004681
03:42:32.780 --> 03:42:34.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Baka pakisilip lang po nito.

asr-004682
03:42:34.780 --> 03:42:38.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalong-lalo na yung mga maliliit na negosyante.

asr-004683
03:42:38.780 --> 03:42:40.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun lang po narinig ko sa baba.

asr-004684
03:42:40.780 --> 03:42:41.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mareklamo nila.

asr-004685
03:42:41.780 --> 03:42:42.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga kiosk.

asr-004686
03:42:42.780 --> 03:42:43.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga maliliit.

asr-004687
03:42:43.780 --> 03:42:45.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maliliit na nagtitinda dyan.

asr-004688
03:42:45.780 --> 03:42:51.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Aside from sa SEC na matagal yung proseso na pagsara nila,

asr-004689
03:42:51.780 --> 03:42:53.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: o pagre-retire ng business nila,

asr-004690
03:42:53.780 --> 03:42:58.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: yung mga business permits pupunta sila sa...

asr-004691
03:42:58.780 --> 03:42:59.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: LGU.

asr-004692
03:42:59.780 --> 03:43:00.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: LGU.

asr-004693
03:43:00.780 --> 03:43:02.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Baka pwede nyo rin pong makausap, Secretary Goh.

asr-004694
03:43:02.780 --> 03:43:04.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Iyan naman ang gusto nyo.

asr-004695
03:43:04.780 --> 03:43:06.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Streamline processes.

asr-004696
03:43:06.780 --> 03:43:07.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pag-apply.

asr-004697
03:43:07.780 --> 03:43:08.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito nang pagsara.

asr-004698
03:43:08.780 --> 03:43:09.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pakicheck nyo naman po.

asr-004699
03:43:09.780 --> 03:43:12.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Baring makausap nyo rin po ang mga LGU.

asr-004700
03:43:12.780 --> 03:43:15.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Under naman po sa inyo yung BLGF, diba?

asr-004701
03:43:15.780 --> 03:43:16.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga treasurer.

asr-004702
03:43:16.780 --> 03:43:19.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maaring dadaan nyo sa kanila rin po.

asr-004703
03:43:19.780 --> 03:43:20.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pakisilip na lang po ito.

asr-004704
03:43:20.780 --> 03:43:22.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun po ang mga reklamo ng mga maliliit na negosyante.

asr-004705
03:43:22.780 --> 03:43:24.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nalugi na nga sila.

asr-004706
03:43:24.780 --> 03:43:30.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pahirapan pa silang magsara ng kanilang negosyo, Secretary Goh.

asr-004707
03:43:30.780 --> 03:43:34.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Malaking tulong po ito sa kanila.

asr-004708
03:43:34.780 --> 03:43:39.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, medyo gusto na po mag-wind up ng ating chairperson.

asr-004709
03:43:39.780 --> 03:43:40.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sabi ko nga sa inyo.

asr-004710
03:43:40.780 --> 03:43:41.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Full support po ako sa inyo.

asr-004711
03:43:41.780 --> 03:43:47.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: With the able leadership ng ating Secretary Frederick Goh ng Finance.

asr-004712
03:43:47.780 --> 03:43:50.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako po'y naniniwala na you are in good hands.

asr-004713
03:43:50.780 --> 03:43:56.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Aside from being a Goh also, Secretary Goh.

asr-004714
03:43:56.780 --> 03:44:02.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam kong magaling ka naman po at you are very competent dyan sa Department of Finance.

asr-004715
03:44:02.780 --> 03:44:04.780
